  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den internationella kommissionen mot straffrihet iGuatemala, CICIG 2013-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Commission against Impunity in  Guatemala, CICIG 2013-2015 - CICIG 2016-2017 (strategy 2016-2020)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNDPs Trust Fund f&#xf6;r den Internationella Kommissionen mot   Straffrihet i Guatemala (CICIG) som uppr&#xe4;ttades efter en f&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan    till FN fr&#xe5;n Guatemalas regering om st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att ta itu med           straffriheten. CICIG arbetar med r&#xe4;tts- och s&#xe4;kerhetsreform och       samarbetar s&#xe4;rskilt med &#xe5;klagarmyndigheten och polisv&#xe4;sendet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the UNDP Trust Fund for the International Commission       against Impunity in Guatemala (CICIG), which was established after a  request to the UN system from the Guatemalan government about support to tackle the impunity situation. CICIG works with justice and        security reform, an cooperates especially with the Guatemalan         prosecution authority and the national civil police.</narrative>
  </description>
